            able to see it.)</mj-text
          >
          <mj-text padding="0px" font-size="13px" line-height="24px" color="#AFAFAF" align="center"
            >© 2022 Nike, Inc. All Rights Reserved.</mj-text
          >
          <mj-text padding="0px" font-size="13px" line-height="24px" color="#AFAFAF" align="center"
            >NIKE, INC. One Bowerman Drive, Beaverton, Oregon 97005, USA.</mj-text
          >
